@loyalty-discount
Feature: Loyalty tier reduction at checkout
  As a returning customer
  I want my loyalty tier reflected in the checkout total
  So that the price I see rewards my history with the brand

  # SETTLED: AC-1, AC-2, AC-3 (values taken verbatim from ac.md).
  # UNSETTLED: AC-4 (wording contradicts its expected value) and the Platinum tier (no agreed reduction).

